  "description": "A Blazor data grid with saved views — show/hide, reorder, resize, sort, filter, and group columns, all in serializable state. Works over an in-memory list or your own data provider, with self-contained CSS (no Bootstrap or Tailwind) themeable through CSS custom properties.",
